    {
      "id": "claim_da9eaacf78444981a08d009e180b6eff",
      "statement": "Accepting a chat is only ever a fast-forward: mergeChanges requires the chat has already merged the gadget's head commit and then creates a plain commit on head; if mainline moved, the user must first update-from-mainline, which computes a three-way merge of merged-head/head/chat trees and delivers the result INTO the chat as an ordinary change while advancing the chat's merged commit.",
